3:5	compose:modifier-reused-check	manual	Modifiers should only be used once and by the root level layout of a Composable. This is true even if appended to or with other modifiers e.g. 'modifier.fillMaxWidth()'.\nUse Modifier (with a capital 'M') to construct a new Modifier that you can pass to other composables.\nSee https://mrmans0n.github.io/compose-rules/rules/#dont-re-use-modifiers for more information.
